{"id": "text-ae5eea", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response correctly names 4-methylimidazole (4-MEI) as the compound and describes its formation the way the filing does. The added caveat about not confirming the fiscal year is a small hedge and doesn't contradict anything.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0009145600000000001, "latency_s": 1.5293815999975777, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-8ee21a", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 43.0, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response correctly states that goodwill and other intangible assets were 43% of total consolidated assets, with a carrying value of $119 billion. Both figures match the reference answer and the filing.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0008914000000000001, "latency_s": 1.8718593999983568, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-658abe", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 1.0, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response correctly states that the reserve was approximately 1.0% of annual net trade sales in fiscal 2024. It also notes the same figure applied in 2023 and 2022, which matches the reference answer completely.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.00084254, "latency_s": 1.5005986000032863, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-2eda6b", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response correctly names the primary driver: the favorable performance of Costa in the United Kingdom. It also correctly includes the offsetting factors, unfavorable product mix and the loss of COVID-related incentives. This matches the reference answer fully.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0010087800000000001, "latency_s": 2.2651755000006233, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-c21c2e", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response correctly names the first fiscal quarter and attributes it in part to seasonal holiday demand, matching the reference answer and the filing language.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0008676400000000001, "latency_s": 1.8032801000008476, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-20b6e4", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "abstained", "correct": false, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": null, "judge_reason": "", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": false, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.00109412, "latency_s": 2.9634775999984413, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-82a7c1", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response matches the reference on both parts. It says the laws require certain data to be maintained, stored and/or processed within the country of origin. It identifies the cost impact as local data centers in individual countries potentially increasing operating costs significantly.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0009260800000000001, "latency_s": 1.5020839999997406, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-5ae9af", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": false, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 3, "judge_reason": "The response captures the core point that AI use in internal systems may create new attack surfaces or methods for adversaries. However, it never commits to what the FY2025 10-K says. It presents two versions, misquotes the generative-AI version as \"new attack methods\" rather than \"new attack surfaces or methods,\" and hints that the broader copilots/agents wording, which is not the reference language, may be the more recent one. This hedging, and the implied lean toward the wrong version, makes the answer only partly correct.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": false, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0012799999999999999, "latency_s": 4.807668499997817, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-1f136d", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response gives both reasons from the reference: customers can keep account balances with Amazon and transfer money to third parties, and Amazon provides services that facilitate payments on behalf of third parties. The added list of resulting requirements (licensing, inspection, bonding, capital maintenance and so on) matches the filing's actual language and is not wrong.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0009610600000000001, "latency_s": 1.7246506000010413, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-889092", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": null, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response gives the same driver as the reference: a lower volume of consoles sold. It is fully correct and complete.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0008759000000000001, "latency_s": 1.348208599996724, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-3711e8", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 165000.0, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response matches the reference exactly. It gives nearly 165,000 clinical professionals out of more than 390,000 employees as of December 31, 2025.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0008645600000000001, "latency_s": 1.3619247999995423, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-39d772", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 20.0, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response matches the reference on every point: AWS sales grew 20%, the growth was driven primarily by increased customer usage, and it was partially offset by pricing changes driven mainly by long-term customer contracts.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0008524, "latency_s": 1.2071329999998852, "error": ""}
{"id": "text-814331", "type": "factual_text", "split": "test", "behavior": "answered", "correct": true, "numeric_value": 11.7, "judge_score": 5, "judge_reason": "The response matches the filing on both parts. It gives STELARA's share of fiscal 2024 total revenues as 11.7%, and it says continued biosimilar launches in Europe and the U.S. in 2025, under patent settlement and license agreements, will affect STELARA sales.", "doc_hit": true, "evidence_hit": true, "citation_hit": null, "faithfulness": null, "cost_usd": 0.0009622400000000001, "latency_s": 2.0383989999972982, "error": ""}
